  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 214
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 那图南漩涡便是在图南海{color=#d0380a}东南部{/color}，按规律算来近期应是要现世了，若无其他事，道友可即刻启程。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 1
  AvatarID: {fileID: 114708266291499853}
  AvatarIntID: 0
